# SkillSwap Wallet System 🎓💡

### AI-Driven Skill Exchange & Credit-Based Learning Platform

SkillSwap Wallet System is a **free peer-to-peer skill exchange platform** designed to help students, freelancers, and professionals learn and share skills without using money.

Instead of financial transactions, the platform uses a **Skill Credit economy** where users can teach skills to earn credits and spend those credits to learn other skills.

> **Knowledge is the currency.**

---

## 📌 Project Overview

The SkillSwap Wallet System was developed as a software development project for the **Higher National Diploma in Information Technology (HNDIT)** at the **Advanced Technological Institute, Batticaloa – SLIATE**.

The system aims to overcome common problems in existing online learning platforms by providing:

* Zero-cost skill exchange
* Skill-based user matching
* Digital skill wallet
* Session management
* Built-in communication
* Reviews and ratings
* Gamification
* Administrative management

New users receive **2 starter Skill Credits** when they register.

---

## 🎯 Main Objective

The main objective of SkillSwap is to create a fair and accessible learning ecosystem where users can:

**Teach → Earn Credits → Learn → Share Knowledge**

The system eliminates the need for direct monetary transactions and encourages users to contribute their knowledge to the community.

---

## ✨ Key Features

### 👤 User Registration & Profile

* Secure user registration
* User profile management
* Profile photo
* Skills offered
* Skills wanted
* User bio
* Skill wallet balance
* Session history

### 💰 Skill Wallet

* Skill Credit balance
* Credit transaction history
* Earn credits by teaching
* Spend credits by learning
* Emergency credit borrowing
* Credit-based transaction tracking

### 🤖 AI-Driven Matchmaking

The matching system suggests suitable users based on:

* Skills offered
* Skills wanted
* User ratings
* Credit balance
* Availability

The system can identify users whose offered skills match another user's learning requirements.

### 🔄 Skill Swap Requests

Users can:

* Send swap requests
* Accept requests
* Reject requests
* Track swap history

### 🕐 Session Management

The system supports:

* Session creation
* Session completion
* Teacher confirmation
* Learner confirmation
* Automatic credit transfer after successful confirmation

Credits are transferred only after both participants confirm the completed session.

### 💬 Communication

Built-in communication features include:

* AJAX-based text chat
* Audio message upload
* Message history
* Communication between matched users

### ⭐ Reviews & Ratings

After completing a session, learners can:

* Give a 5-star rating
* Write a review
* View teacher ratings
* Build a trusted reputation

### 🏆 Gamification

The platform encourages participation through:

* XP points
* Bronze badge
* Silver badge
* Gold badge
* Teaching streaks

### 🛠️ Admin Dashboard

Administrators can manage:

* Users
* Sessions
* Reports
* Suspended accounts
* Platform analytics
* Data exports

---

## 💳 Skill Credit Economy

The platform uses a simple credit-based model:

| Activity              |             Credit |
| --------------------- | -----------------: |
| 1 hour teaching       |    +1 Skill Credit |
| 1 hour learning       |    -1 Skill Credit |
| New user registration | +2 Starter Credits |

This creates a fair exchange system where users contribute knowledge before consuming other learning services.

---

## 🏗️ System Architecture

The system follows a modular web application architecture.

```text
                    ┌─────────────────────┐
                    │      Users          │
                    └──────────┬──────────┘
                               │
                               ▼
                    ┌─────────────────────┐
                    │   Web Application   │
                    │   User Interface    │
                    └──────────┬──────────┘
                               │
             ┌─────────────────┼─────────────────┐
             │                 │                 │
             ▼                 ▼                 ▼
       User Profiles      Matchmaking       Skill Wallet
             │                 │                 │
             └─────────────────┼─────────────────┘
                               │
                               ▼
                    ┌─────────────────────┐
                    │    PHP Backend      │
                    └──────────┬──────────┘
                               │
                               ▼
                    ┌─────────────────────┐
                    │      MySQL DB       │
                    └─────────────────────┘
```

